1
00:00:00,096 --> 00:00:01,826
(Mrs Cooper:)from one of his friends.

2
00:00:01,831 --> 00:00:02,831
(Penny:)Yeah.

3
00:00:02,832 --> 00:00:04,232
(Sheldon:)But I wasn't.

4
00:00:04,234 --> 00:00:07,004
'Cause I didn't
have any friends.

5
00:00:07,003 --> 00:00:08,603
(laughs):
No.

6
00:00:09,938 --> 00:00:11,938
(Mrs Cooper:)It turns out that this
little scallywag was trying

7
00:00:11,941 --> 00:00:14,541
(Mrs Cooper:)to use my Visa card
to buy uranium

8
00:00:14,544 --> 00:00:18,584
(Mrs Cooper:)from an African warlord
in the country of Chad!

9
00:00:20,916 --> 00:00:22,916
(Dr Hofstadter:)Sounds like Sheldon
was a handful.

10
00:00:22,919 --> 00:00:24,519
(Mrs Cooper:)Oh, he was a handful.

11
00:00:24,521 --> 00:00:27,421
(Sheldon:)I was a handful.

12
00:00:27,424 --> 00:00:29,524
(Leonard:)You still are.

13
00:00:32,728 --> 00:00:36,128
(Leonard:)Uh, Mom, hey,
tell Mary the story

14
00:00:36,132 --> 00:00:38,732
(Leonard:)about how I made
a Van de Graaff generator

15
00:00:38,735 --> 00:00:40,465
(Leonard:)out of our vacuum cleaner.

16
00:00:40,470 --> 00:00:41,540
(Dr Hofstadter:)All right.

17
00:00:41,538 --> 00:00:44,338
(Dr Hofstadter:)He broke the
vacuum cleaner.

18
00:00:46,475 --> 00:00:48,345
(video game sound effects
playing)

19
00:00:50,312 --> 00:00:53,312
(Howard:)I mean, for a while,
everything was vampires.

20
00:00:53,316 --> 00:00:54,916
(Howard:)Now it's all zombies.

21
00:00:54,918 --> 00:00:57,548
(Howard:)I wonder what the next
monster fad will be.

22
00:00:57,554 --> 00:01:00,154
(Raj:)We haven't had a good
invisible man in a while.

